| **RCI-3 EPD Name** | PNC (Medium) |
| **RCI-4 Phase** | Overall |
| **RCI-5 N** | 512 (single model: dMRI white matter normative model FA/FAt/FW) (High) |
| **RCI-6 Sex** | Female 233 (45.5%), Male 279 (54.5%) — male_nは直接報告、female_nはN−male_nで算出、Discussionで確認済み (High) |
| **RCI-7 Age** | mean=30.15, SD=14.26, min/max=NR (High) |

主な根拠テキスト: "512 healthy controls (mean [SD] age, 30.15 [14.26] years; 279 [54.49%] male)" (Methods 2.1) および "dMRI data were collated from 13 different sites" (Methods 2.1)。PNCはEthics Approval and Patient Consentセクションで明示。
